  <entry>
    <title>搭建流程</title>
    <url>/2018/02/05/%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<p>本文最初写于 2018 年，记录 GitHub + Hexo 搭建个人博客的流程。<strong>2026 年 9 月更换新电脑后按本文重新完整走了一遍，内容已全面刷新为 runbook 形式</strong>：所有命令、配置与版本组合都在新电脑上实际验证通过，遇到问题直接看「四、问题集合」。以后无论是<strong>全新搭建</strong>还是<strong>旧电脑报废后的迁移恢复</strong>，照本文操作即可。（精华帖）</p>
<span id="more"></span>
<p><img src="/2018/02/05/%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B/title.jpg" alt="博客搭建流程配图"></p>
<h2 id="适用环境（本博客实测版本）">适用环境（本博客实测版本）</h2>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>组件</th>
<th>版本</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>操作系统</td>
<td>Windows 10/11（PowerShell）</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Node.js</td>
<td>v20.20.2（<strong>不要用 Node 24+，见问题集合</strong>）</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>npm</td>
<td>10.8.2（建议配 npmmirror 镜像源）</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Git</td>
<td>2.55.0（Git for Windows）</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Hexo</td>
<td>7.3.0（<strong>不要用 8.x，见问题集合</strong>）</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>主题</td>
<td>NexT 8.29.0（Gemini 风格）</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>评论</td>
<td>Utterances（GitHub Issues）</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h2 id="简介：GitHub-Pages-＆-Hexo">简介：GitHub Pages ＆ Hexo</h2>
<h3 id="GitHub-Pages-是什么？">GitHub Pages 是什么？</h3>
<p>GitHub Pages 是 GitHub 官方提供的免费静态站点托管服务，把公开仓库直接发布成网站，支持 HTTPS、免费、无停服风险——非常适合个人博客。</p>
<h3 id="Hexo-是什么？">Hexo 是什么？</h3>
<p>Hexo 是基于 Node.js 的静态博客框架，Markdown 写作，一条命令生成静态页面并部署到 GitHub Pages。<strong>部署产物（master 分支）与源文件（source 分支）分开管理</strong>是本博客的核心架构。</p>
<h2 id="一、从零搭建（新电脑-新博客）">一、从零搭建（新电脑 / 新博客）</h2>
<h3 id="1-1-环境准备">1.1 环境准备</h3>
<ol>
<li>注册 <a href="https://github.com/">GitHub</a> 账号，新建仓库 <code>&lt;用户名&gt;.github.io</code>（公开仓库，<strong>开启 Issues</strong>，供 Utterances 使用）；</li>
<li>安装 <a href="https://git-scm.com/download/win">Git for Windows</a> 与 <a href="https://nodejs.org/">Node.js LTS</a>；</li>
<li>配置全局 git 身份（换新电脑后必做，否则部署会报 <code>unable to auto-detect email address</code>）：</li>
</ol>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git config --global user.name <span class="string">&quot;你的名字&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">git config --global user.email <span class="string">&quot;你的邮箱@example.com&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 验证</span></span><br><span class="line">git config --global user.name</span><br><span class="line">git config --global user.email</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<blockquote>
<p><code>user.email</code> 建议填 GitHub 绑定邮箱；不想暴露真实邮箱，可在 GitHub Settings → Emails 里查你的专属 <code>xxx@users.noreply.github.com</code>。</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 id="1-2-初始化站点">1.2 初始化站点</h3>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 在目标目录执行（本博客在 D:\Code\blog）</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo init blog</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> blog</span><br><span class="line">npm install</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<blockquote>
<p><code>hexo init</code> 生成 <code>source/_posts/</code>、<code>_config.yml</code>、<code>package.json</code> 等基础结构。</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 id="1-3-安装主题与插件">1.3 安装主题与插件</h3>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 安装 NexT 主题（npm 装好后要复制到 themes/next 才会生效）</span></span><br><span class="line">npm install hexo-theme-next@8.29.0</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">mkdir</span> themes</span><br><span class="line">Copy-Item -Recurse node_modules/hexo-theme-next themes/next</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 渲染器与部署插件</span></span><br><span class="line">npm install hexo-renderer-marked hexo-renderer-stylus hexo-server hexo-deployer-git</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 可选：本地搜索 / RSS / 站点地图</span></span><br><span class="line">npm install hexo-generator-searchdb hexo-generator-feed hexo-generator-sitemap</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>重要</strong>：确认 <code>package.json</code> 里包含 <code>&quot;hexo&quot;: &#123; &quot;version&quot;: &quot;7.3.0&quot; &#125;</code> 字段，缺了它 Hexo 不会加载任何外部插件（生成 0 篇文章），详见问题集合。</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 id="1-4-站点配置-config-yml">1.4 站点配置 <code>_config.yml</code></h3>
<figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">title:</span> <span class="string">HuangR&#x27;s</span> <span class="string">Blog</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">subtitle:</span> <span class="string">记录世界，记录你！</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">author:</span> <span class="string">黄锐</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">language:</span> <span class="string">zh-CN</span>          <span class="comment"># NexT 8 无 zh-Hans，必须用 zh-CN</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">timezone:</span> <span class="string">Asia/Shanghai</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">url:</span> <span class="string">https://你的用户名.github.io/</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">theme:</span> <span class="string">next</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">deploy:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">type:</span> <span class="string">git</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">repo:</span> <span class="string">https://github.com/你的用户名/你的用户名.github.io.git</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">branch:</span> <span class="string">master</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h3 id="1-5-主题配置（站点根目录建-config-next-yml）">1.5 主题配置（站点根目录建 <code>_config.next.yml</code>）</h3>
<figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">scheme:</span> <span class="string">Gemini</span>                        <span class="comment"># 风格</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">sidebar:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">position:</span> <span class="string">left</span>                      <span class="comment"># 侧栏在左</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">display:</span> <span class="string">post</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">avatar:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">url:</span> <span class="string">/images/avatar.gif</span>             <span class="comment"># 自定义头像放 source/images/</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">rounded:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">menu:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">home:</span> <span class="string">/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fa</span> <span class="string">fa-home</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">about:</span> <span class="string">/about/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fa</span> <span class="string">fa-user</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">tags:</span> <span class="string">/tags/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fa</span> <span class="string">fa-tags</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">categories:</span> <span class="string">/categories/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fa</span> <span class="string">fa-th</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">local_search:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>                        <span class="comment"># 本地搜索</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">busuanzi_count:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>                        <span class="comment"># 访问统计</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">post_copyright:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>                        <span class="comment"># 文章版权</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">mediumzoom:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>                     <span class="comment"># 图片点击放大（需把 medium-zoom 下载到 source/lib/medium-zoom/）</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">creative_commons:</span>                     <span class="comment"># 版权协议（文章页底部 CC BY-NC-SA）</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">license:</span> <span class="string">by-nc-sa</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">post:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">codeblock:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">language:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>                     <span class="comment"># 代码块显示语言标签</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">theme:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">dark:</span> <span class="string">atom-one-dark</span>               <span class="comment"># highlight.js 11 无 tomorrow-night</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">darkmode:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>                       <span class="comment"># 暗色模式（跟随系统 prefers-color-scheme）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">mobile_layout_economy:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>          <span class="comment"># 窄屏紧凑布局</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">back2top:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">scrollpercent:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>                 <span class="comment"># 回到顶部+阅读进度</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">reward_settings:</span>                      <span class="comment"># 打赏（收款码放 source/images/）</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">reward:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">wechatpay:</span> <span class="string">/images/wechatpay.jpg</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">alipay:</span> <span class="string">/images/alipay.jpg</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">utterances:</span>                           <span class="comment"># 评论</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">repo:</span> <span class="string">你的用户名/你的用户名.github.io</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">issue_term:</span> <span class="string">pathname</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">theme:</span> <span class="string">github-light</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">language:</span> <span class="string">zh-CN</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h3 id="1-6-首次发布">1.6 首次发布</h3>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo clean</span><br><span class="line">hexo g          <span class="comment"># 生成</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo s          <span class="comment"># 本地预览 http://localhost:4000，确认无误后</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo d          <span class="comment"># 部署（首次会弹出 GitHub 登录授权）</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<blockquote>
<p>部署后网站 1~2 分钟更新属正常，无需重复操作。</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="二、日常写作、发布与备份">二、日常写作、发布与备份</h2>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo new <span class="string">&quot;文章标题&quot;</span>        <span class="comment"># 新建（标题含空格必须加引号）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 编辑 source/_posts/标题.md，填写 front-matter（title/date/categories/tags）后写正文</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">hexo g &amp;&amp; hexo s          <span class="comment"># 本地预览确认</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo d                    <span class="comment"># 发布到线上</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p><strong>源文件备份（血泪教训，必做）</strong>：本博客曾因旧电脑报废、源文件只存本地而全部丢失。源文件必须推送到 GitHub 的 <code>source</code> 分支（与部署产物 <code>master</code> 分开）：</p>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git init</span><br><span class="line">git add .</span><br><span class="line">git commit -m <span class="string">&quot;博客源文件&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">git remote add origin https://github.com/你的用户名/你的用户名.github.io.git</span><br><span class="line">git push -u origin HEAD:<span class="built_in">source</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>之后每次写完文章，发布 + 备份一起做：</p>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo d</span><br><span class="line">git add . &amp;&amp; git commit -m <span class="string">&quot;更新文章：xxx&quot;</span> &amp;&amp; git push origin HEAD:<span class="built_in">source</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>换电脑恢复：<code>git clone -b source &lt;仓库&gt;</code> → <code>npm install</code> → 按需 <code>npm install &lt;主题与插件&gt;</code> → 开写。<strong>源文件在，博客就丢不了。</strong></p>
<h2 id="三、旧站迁移-恢复（旧电脑报废场景）">三、旧站迁移 / 恢复（旧电脑报废场景）</h2>
<p>适用：旧电脑已不可用，但 GitHub 线上仓库（部署产物）还在。<strong>仓库里只有编译产物、没有源文件</strong>，需要从静态站反推恢复。以下为实测完整流程：</p>
<h3 id="3-1-下载旧仓库">3.1 下载旧仓库</h3>
<p>GitHub 直连不稳，走镜像加速（在原始链接前加 <code>https://ghfast.top/</code>）：</p>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">curl.exe -L -o blog.tar.gz <span class="string">&quot;https://ghfast.top/https://github.com/你的用户名/你的用户名.github.io/archive/refs/heads/master.tar.gz&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<blockquote>
<p>PowerShell 中 <code>curl</code> 是 <code>Invoke-WebRequest</code> 的别名，参数不兼容，<strong>必须写 <code>curl.exe</code></strong>。</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 id="3-2-解压">3.2 解压</h3>
<p>Windows 自带 <code>tar</code> 解压中文文件名会乱码，改用 Python：</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> tarfile</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">with</span> tarfile.<span class="built_in">open</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;blog.tar.gz&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;r:gz&#x27;</span>) <span class="keyword">as</span> t:</span><br><span class="line">    t.extractall(<span class="string">&#x27;blog-static&#x27;</span>)   <span class="comment"># 文件名编码正常</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h3 id="3-3-提取文章清单">3.3 提取文章清单</h3>
<p>旧站里能拿到：<code>index.html</code>（首页）、<code>archives/</code>（归档）、<code>categories/</code>、<code>tags/</code>、各年份文章目录、<code>atom.xml</code>（含全部文章元数据）、<code>search.xml</code>。</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>元数据</strong>（标题/日期/分类/标签/摘要）：解析 <code>atom.xml</code>（UTF-8，注意 <code>&lt;content&gt;</code> 里是 HTML 转义）；</li>
<li><strong>正文</strong>：<code>&lt;!-- more --&gt;</code> 之后的内容在 atom 里只有截断摘要，<strong>完整正文要从文章页 <code>&lt;div class=&quot;post-body&quot;&gt;</code> 里提取</strong>（含代码块、图片、PDF 嵌入）。</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="3-4-HTML-→-Markdown-转换要点">3.4 HTML → Markdown 转换要点</h3>
<p>用 Python（BeautifulSoup 或正则）逐篇转换，重点处理：</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>原站元素</th>
<th>转换规则</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>figure.highlight</code> 代码块</td>
<td>按 <code>span.line</code> 还原行内容，<strong>去掉嵌套的 class span 干扰</strong>，缩进按行首空格保留</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>标题/段落/列表/表格/引用</td>
<td>转对应 Markdown 语法</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>图片 <code>&lt;img&gt;</code></td>
<td>保留原路径（<code>/2018/02/05/xxx/title.jpg</code> 这类文章资源目录）</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;embed&gt;</code>（PDF）</td>
<td>保留为 HTML 标签（浏览器端 PDF 阅读器）</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;!-- more --&gt;</code></td>
<td>保留为摘要截断标记</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>HTML 实体</td>
<td><code>&amp;gt;</code>/<code>&amp;amp;</code> 等要解码回原字符</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3 id="3-5-资源搬运清单">3.5 资源搬运清单</h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>资源</th>
<th>目标位置（新站）</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>文章图片</td>
<td>按原 URL 路径放 <code>source/</code>（如 <code>source/2018/02/05/搭建流程/</code>）</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>PDF 附件</td>
<td><code>source/pdf/</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>自定义头像/背景/打赏码</td>
<td><code>source/images/</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>about 页</td>
<td><code>source/about/index.md</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3 id="3-6-重建与部署">3.6 重建与部署</h3>
<p>按本文「一」搭好新站 → 把转换好的 <code>.md</code> 放入 <code>source/_posts/</code> → <code>hexo g</code> 逐篇核对渲染（重点：代码高亮、图片、PDF、TOC）→ 按「二」配置备份 → <code>hexo d</code> 部署。<strong>若线上仓库已有历史提交，部署会被拒，需强制推送</strong>（见问题集合）。</p>
<h2 id="四、问题集合（全部实测）">四、问题集合（全部实测）</h2>
<h3 id="GitHub-直连超时-TLS-报错（schannel-CRYPT-E-NO-REVOCATION-CHECK）">GitHub 直连超时 / TLS 报错（schannel CRYPT_E_NO_REVOCATION_CHECK）</h3>
<p>国内访问 GitHub 不稳定，clone/curl 常超时或报 TLS 错。<strong>解决</strong>：走镜像 <code>https://ghfast.top/</code> 前缀加速下载。</p>
<h3 id="hexo-8-x-命令无效（只显示-usage）-建议用-7-x">hexo 8.x 命令无效（只显示 usage）/ 建议用 7.x</h3>
<p>Hexo 8 存在兼容问题（console 命令空白）。<strong>解决</strong>：固定 7.3.0：</p>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo@7.3.0</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h3 id="package-json-缺-hexo-字段导致生成-0-篇文章">package.json 缺 hexo 字段导致生成 0 篇文章</h3>
<p>缺 <code>&quot;hexo&quot;: &#123; &quot;version&quot;: &quot;x.x.x&quot; &#125;</code> 时 Hexo 认为站点未初始化，不加载任何插件（渲染器/生成器失效）。<strong>解决</strong>：补上该字段并重新 <code>npm install</code>。</p>
<h3 id="主题报-template-not-found-layout-njk">主题报 template not found: _layout.njk</h3>
<p>外部 <code>hexo-renderer-nunjucks</code> 破坏主题模板相对路径解析。<strong>解决</strong>：卸载，用 Hexo 7 内置 nunjucks：</p>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm uninstall hexo-renderer-nunjucks</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h3 id="代码高亮主题失效">代码高亮主题失效</h3>
<p>highlight.js 11 已移除 <code>tomorrow-night</code>。<strong>解决</strong>：<code>codeblock.theme.dark</code> 用 <code>atom-one-dark</code>。</p>
<h3 id="页面语言变德语（Suche-Erstellt）">页面语言变德语（Suche/Erstellt）</h3>
<p>语言代码不匹配导致回退默认语言。NexT 8 只有 <code>zh-CN.yml</code>。<strong>解决</strong>：<code>language: zh-CN</code>。</p>
<h3 id="部署报-unable-to-auto-detect-email-address">部署报 unable to auto-detect email address</h3>
<p><code>.deploy_git</code> 子仓库读不到仓库级身份。<strong>解决</strong>：配置全局 git 身份（见 1.1）。</p>
<h3 id="Error-listen-EADDRINUSE-4000">Error: listen EADDRINUSE :::4000</h3>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">netstat -ano | findstr <span class="string">&quot;4000&quot;</span>   <span class="comment"># 找到 PID</span></span><br><span class="line">taskkill -PID 8976 -F           <span class="comment"># 结束进程</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h3 id="部署被拒：-rejected-master-master-fetch-first">部署被拒：! [rejected] master -&gt; master (fetch first)</h3>
<p>线上仓库有旧历史（如迁移场景），部署产物是整体替换，直接强制推送：</p>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git -C .deploy_git push -u origin master --force</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h3 id="Windows-tar-解压中文乱码">Windows tar 解压中文乱码</h3>
<p>用 Python <code>tarfile</code> 解压（见 3.2），或 PowerShell 指定编码后处理。</p>
<h3 id="Code-504-The-app-is-archived（Valine-时代遗留，已过时）">Code 504: The app is archived（Valine 时代遗留，已过时）</h3>
<p>老方案 Valine 依赖的 LeanCloud <strong>2027-01-12 全面停服、数据销毁</strong>，本站已迁移 Utterances。如旧站页面残留 Valine 凭据（appId/appKey），仅作历史存档即可，不再使用。</p>
<h3 id="source-404-html-被-Hexo-渲染成完整布局（带侧栏-评论区）">source/404.html 被 Hexo 渲染成完整布局（带侧栏/评论区）</h3>
<p>Hexo 7 会把 source 根的 .html 当页面渲染进主题布局（意外出现侧栏+评论区）。<strong>解决</strong>：404.html 顶部加 front-matter layout: false 即原样输出独立页。</p>
<h2 id="五、LaTeX-学习笔记转博客正文（2026-09-实测）">五、LaTeX 学习笔记转博客正文（2026-09 实测）</h2>
<p>场景：旧站部分文章以 <code>&lt;embed src=&quot;/pdf/xxx.pdf&quot;&gt;</code> 嵌入 PDF 展示，不优雅且移动端体验差。本站在 Overleaf 有 LaTeX 源（ctexart + morelull 模板），可整体转为 Markdown 正文，公式用 KaTeX 渲染。</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>2026-09 现状</strong>：本站已尝试该方案并完成部署，但因排版与 PDF 原版仍有差距，已<strong>回退为 PDF 嵌入显示</strong>。本章完整保留转换方法、渲染器配置与全部坑点，如需再试可直接复用。</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 id="5-1-获取-Overleaf-源文件">5.1 获取 Overleaf 源文件</h3>
<ul>
<li>项目页可浏览器下载 zip：<strong>点击按钮后 <code>wait_for_download</code></strong>（<code>bu.download(zip链接)</code> 直下无效、按钮被浮层遮挡时用 JS 按 <code>[aria-label=&quot;Download .zip file&quot;]</code> 点击）。</li>
<li>zip 解压结构：<code>main.tex</code> + <code>demo.tex</code> + <code>morelull.sty</code>（自定义模板宏包）+ <code>imgs&amp;code/</code>（图片）。</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="5-2-pandoc-转换（pypandoc-binary，pandoc-3-9）">5.2 pandoc 转换（pypandoc-binary，pandoc 3.9）</h3>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> pypandoc</span><br><span class="line">md = pypandoc.convert_file(<span class="string">&#x27;main.tex&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;markdown&#x27;</span>,</span><br><span class="line">      extra_args=[<span class="string">&#x27;--wrap=none&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;--resource-path=&lt;项目&gt;/imgs&amp;code&#x27;</span>])</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<ul>
<li><strong>必须 <code>--resource-path</code> 指向图片目录</strong>，否则图片引用丢失；图片实际在 <code>imgs&amp;code/</code>（不是 images/）。</li>
<li>pandoc 对 <code>\includegraphics[scale=...]</code> 输出<strong>无尺寸的 <code>&lt;img&gt;</code></strong>；对 <code>[width=...]</code> 输出 <code>&lt;img style=&quot;width:90%&quot;&gt;</code>。都不是 markdown 图片语法。</li>
<li><strong>预处理</strong>：删除 <code>\usepackage&#123;morelull&#125;</code>（pandoc 解析该宏包会报错）；自定义环境 <code>&#123;提醒&#125;/&#123;问题&#125;/&#123;特点&#125;</code> → <code>&#123;quote&#125;</code>，否则内容丢失。</li>
<li><strong>CRLF 坑</strong>：pandoc 输出用 <code>\r\n</code>，行首正则全部失效，<code>clean()</code> 开头必须 <code>text.replace('\r\n', '\n')</code>。</li>
<li>pandoc 会给标题加属性 <code># 标题 {#id}</code>——<strong>hexo 会把它当模板注释解析报 FATAL</strong>（expected end of comment），转换后必须删掉 <code> {#xxx}</code>。</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="5-3-渲染器：markdown-it-KaTeX（关键决策）">5.3 渲染器：markdown-it + KaTeX（关键决策）</h3>
<p>hexo-renderer-marked <strong>会把 <code>$$...$$</code> 公式内容当普通 Markdown 解析</strong>（<code>_</code> 变斜体、<code>&amp;</code> 转义、公式被拆成段落/代码块），必须换渲染器：</p>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm un hexo-renderer-marked</span><br><span class="line">npm i hexo-renderer-markdown-it @renbaoshuo/markdown-it-katex</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p><code>_config.yml</code>：</p>
<figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">markdown:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">render:</span> &#123; <span class="attr">html:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>, <span class="attr">breaks:</span> <span class="literal">false</span>, <span class="attr">linkify:</span> <span class="literal">true</span> &#125;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">plugins:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="attr">name:</span> <span class="string">&#x27;@renbaoshuo/markdown-it-katex&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">options:</span> &#123; <span class="attr">throwOnError:</span> <span class="literal">false</span>, <span class="attr">strict:</span> <span class="literal">false</span> &#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>主题 <code>_config.next.yml</code>（按页加载，仅含公式的文章加载）：</p>
<figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">math:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">every_page:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">mathjax:</span> &#123; <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">false</span> &#125;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">katex:</span> &#123; <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>, <span class="attr">copy_tex:</span> <span class="literal">true</span> &#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>文章 front-matter 必须加 <strong><code>mathjax: true</code></strong>（NexT 8 按页触发判断的就是这个字段，即使引擎是 KaTeX）。</p>
<h3 id="5-4-排版坑清单（全部实测）">5.4 排版坑清单（全部实测）</h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>问题</th>
<th>处理</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>正文 section 变 h1，6 个大标题抢文章标题层级</td>
<td>转换后所有标题降一级（<code>#</code>→<code>##</code>）</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>无尺寸大图溢出正文容器</td>
<td>所有 <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> 统一加 <code>max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>figure/figcaption 无样式</td>
<td>主题 <code>custom_file_path.style: source/_data/styles.styl</code> 加样式</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>块级公式不渲染</td>
<td><code>$$...$$</code> 必须独占段落（前后补空行）</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>\text&#123;$y=1$&#125;</code> 嵌套 $</td>
<td>去除 \text 内层 $；<code>W_i_K</code> 双下标按语义改 <code>W_i^K</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>$^&#123;\ref&#123;xx&#125;&#125;$</code> 清理后残留孤立 <code>$$</code></td>
<td>先整删 <code>$^&#123;\ref&#123;xx&#125;&#125;$</code> 再删 <code>\ref&#123;xx&#125;</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>pandoc 对齐式表格不渲染为 table</td>
<td>转成 markdown 管道表格（或 <code>-t markdown+pipe_tables</code>）</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>表格内 <code>$\geq$</code> 不渲染</td>
<td>直接替换为 Unicode <code>≥</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>hexo 增量生成不检测 md 变化（0 files）</td>
<td>转换后务必 <code>hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo g</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3 id="5-5-验证与部署">5.5 验证与部署</h3>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npx hexo clean &amp;&amp; npx hexo g     <span class="comment"># 生成</span></span><br><span class="line">npx hexo server -p 4000          <span class="comment"># 本地预览：公式/图片/表格逐篇过</span></span><br><span class="line">python scan_pages.py             <span class="comment"># 脚本扫描 katex-err/残留/坏图</span></span><br><span class="line">npx hexo d                       <span class="comment"># 部署 master</span></span><br><span class="line">git add -A &amp;&amp; git commit -m ... &amp;&amp; git push origin HEAD:<span class="built_in">source</span>  <span class="comment"># 备份源文件</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>转换脚本复用：<code>convert_tex.py</code>（含以上全部修复，跑一遍重出 5 篇 md 并重拷图片），位于本站工具目录（见 README）。</p>
]]></content>
